			"notes": "## Player Data Rework\nInvolves changes in the internal player data system to make changes to player data files much easier and faster to do.\n\n## Personal Sidebars\nThis feature allows you to select what sidebar to display for your client only.\n\n__Commands__\n`/personalsidebar <show/clear/list>` (also `/psb`)\n\n## Combat Timer & Pvp Option\nThis features adds a toggleable pvp setting and a combat timer. The combat timer is used to disabled keep inventory for players who are in combat. This only takes in account for melee combat currently. There will be a small update expanding on this.\n\n__Commands__\n`/pvp` - Toggles pvp"
		},
