			"notes": "**What is the QOL Update?**\nThe QOL Update is an update that focuses on adding QOL features to make vanilla experiences better, or make plugin features easier to use. This update has been split into different parts to be released as it would be too many different things to be released at once. This update release contains the features: chat channels, chat links, and emojis.\n\n\n**Chat Channels**\n__Overview__\n(You should already know what they are)\n\n__Commands__\n`/chatchannel <channel>` - Sets the chat channel. (Alias: `chat, cc`)\n\n\n**Chat Links**\n__Overview__\nThis feature allows players to makes links sent in chat clickable. With this, there is now a whitelist for what links you can send.\n\n\n**Emojis**\n__Overview__\nThis feature allows emojis, set in the server, to be sent.\n\n__Commands__\n`/emojis` - Gets the list of available emojis.\n\n## What's Changed\n* Use GitHub actions by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/5\n* Sound sequencing by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/4\n* Messenger to send messages of certain format and easily format messages by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/6\n* Conditions for ItemTraits by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/7\n* 1.19.1 by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/8\n* 1.19.2 by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/9\n* Command rework by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/10\n* Feature system by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/12\n* 1.19.4 by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/13\n* Emojis by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/15\n* Chat Links & Channels by @GeoWhat404 in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/14\n* Fix team disband NullPointerException by @Zenqrt in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/18\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Zenqrt made their first contribution in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/5\n* @GeoWhat404 made their first contribution in https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/pull/14\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Mini-Squid/SMPContent/compare/v0.0.1-alpha...v1.0.0"
		}
